    "expected.<key>.chain lists scenario ids from the root ancestor to the scenario itself.",
    "expected.<key>.values[].scenario_id is the level that supplied the value (null = tenant default).",
    "Rows are ordered by var_key, then member_key, in code-point order (COLLATE \"C\")."
